      en: ["The museum was formally founded by Pope Gregory XVI in 1837.", "Many artifacts were excavated from the Etruscan city of Vulci.", "The 'Mars of Todi' is a celebrated 5th-century BC bronze statue.", "It houses the spectacular gold artifacts from the Regolini-Galassi tomb.", "The collection is distributed across 22 exhibition rooms.", "It includes a renowned collection of Greek vases found in Italy."],
