      en: ["Piazza del Forno houses the official bakery of the Vatican state.", "The bakery produces traditional rolls and bread for the papal household.", "The square is located near Saint Anne's Gate and the Gendarmerie.", "It functions as a central point for receiving commercial deliveries.", "Historically, the area was vital for the food security of the Apostolic Palace.", "The square is one of the busiest spots during the early morning hours."],
