      en: ["Construction period from 1776 to 1784", "Architect: Carlo Marchionni", "Commissioned by Pope Pius VI", "Style: Late 18th-century Neoclassicism", "Residence of the Canons of St. Peter's", "Directly connected to the Basilica's sacristy"],
